            "review_text": "banananor\nLondon, United Kingdom33 contributions\n0\nOne of our best meals in Vietnam!\nJan 2024 • Couples\nFound this place hidden in District 1 and absolutely loved it. They were still closed when we showed up, but the staff was so welcoming and told us they can serve us early anyway. The food was great - we tried many dishes and loved them all. Food is all very rich and perfect level of spice. Spent 2 weeks in Vietnam and this might have been our favorite meal from the entire trip.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 6, 2024",
