            "review_text": "andylee87\nSan Jose, California118 contributions\n0\nSome of the best seafood in the world\nJul 2022 • Couples\nOne of my favorite meals in Saigon, which says a lot because I believe that this is one of the food capitals of the world. Highly recommend getting there earlier because some dishes will sell out. Our order: salted egg chicken feet, salted egg cartilage, snails in coconut sauce. You can’t really go wrong with any snail and any sauce combo. Wasn’t a big fan of the Cajun-style boil or the scallops, but everything else was so good. A must-try when you’re in Saigon.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 24, 2022",
